effects.ChroniaHelper/Bloom.name=Bloom
effects.ChroniaHelper/Bloom.attributes.name.strength=Strength
effects.ChroniaHelper/Bloom.attributes.description.strength=How much of the blurred background is added back. 0 disables the effect.
effects.ChroniaHelper/Bloom.attributes.name.blur=Blur
effects.ChroniaHelper/Bloom.attributes.description.blur=Blur radius multiplier for the background.
